<title>USA: General Re Corp Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>General Re Corp Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.31		    $2.39</p>
<p> Net			  184.3		    198.8</p>
<p> Oper Revs		2,035.6		  2,011.1</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  78,423		   82,180</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $8.00		    $7.17</p>
<p> Net			  645.4		    596.1</p>
<p> Revs		     5,971.3		  5,116.6</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  79,707		   82,033</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The First Call consensus estimate for Q3 was $2.68 per share.</p>
<p>The Q3 results includes $0.42 per share of after-tax realized capital losses, compared with $0.04 per share after-tax realized capital losses the same period in 1995. Consolidated net written premiums for the third quarter were $1.66 billion compared with $1.69 billion the same period last year.</p>
</text>
